BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:7D4BeCxr-PTByqVJ9NY2X
SUMMARY:DEFCON Halifax
DTSTAMP:20260915T174748Z
DTSTART:20251106T223000Z
DTEND:20251107T003000Z
DESCRIPTION:Join DEFCON Halifax on Nov 6th at Volta! Network and hear Levi 
	Ogbaje talk about the skills and mindset you need to break into CyberSecur
	ity\nDEFCON Halifax – November Meet-Up\n\n📅 𝗗𝗮𝘁𝗲: Thursday\, November 6th\
	, 2025\n\n🕡 𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲: 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM\n\n📍 𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Volta\, Halifax\n\n\n🎤 
	𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗱 𝗧𝗮𝗹𝗸:\n\nBreaking into Cybersecurity: Skills and Mindset for Begi
	nners\n\nPresented by Levi Ogbaje\, an IT professional with experience in 
	technical support\, cybersecurity\, and network system management. In this
	 session\, Levi will share insights into the skills and mindset a beginner
	 needs to break into the field of Cybersecurity.\n\n\n\n🔍 What’s This All 
	About?\n\nDEFCON Halifax is your local hub for hackers\, tinkerers\, and c
	ybersecurity pros. Whether you're just curious or deep in the field\, you'
	re welcome here. Come to learn\, connect\, and be part of Halifax’s growin
	g infosec community.\n\n\n\n💡 Why You Should Come:\n\nMeet fellow hackers\
	, makers\, and defenders\nLearn about the latest security trends and best 
	practices\nShare knowledge in a laid-back\, pressure-free environment\nNo 
	sponsors. No sales. Just real people and real conversations\n\n\n🤝 Communi
	ty-Powered and Proudly Sponsor-Free\n\nDEFCON Halifax is dedicated to crea
	ting a space free from sales pitches. This means we depend on our communit
	y's generosity to cover small expenses.\n\nYou'll see an optional donation
	 field when you register for your free ticket. If you're able to contribut
	e a few dollars\, it would be greatly appreciated. Rest assured\, all dona
	tions go directly towards making DC902 events even better. Thank you for h
	elping us grow this community!\n\n\n\n📅 𝗦𝗰𝗵𝗲𝗱𝘂𝗹𝗲:\n\n6:30 PM – Doors Open 
	+ Networking\n6:55 PM – Welcome\n7:00 PM – Levi Ogbaje’s Talk\n7:40 PM – Q
	&A\n8:00 PM – More Networking\n8:30 PM – Wrap-Up
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/defcon-halifax-november-meet-up-tickets-182
	5669479559
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:community
END:VEVENT
