	e latest security trends and best practices</p></li><li><p>Share knowledge
	 in a laid-back\, pressure-free environment</p></li><li><p>No sponsors. No
	 sales. Just real people and real conversations</p></li></ul><p></p><p>🤝 <
	strong>Community-Powered and Proudly Sponsor-Free</strong></p><p><strong>D
	EFCON Halifax</strong> aims to create an environment free from sales pitch
	es. We depend on our community's generosity to cover small expenses. When 
	you register for your free ticket\, you'll see an optional donation field.
	 Please donate a few dollars.</p><p>All donations go directly to enhancing
