BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:C-tN9cCPVztmRCkOx9ue6
SUMMARY:Radiant Voices\, Resilient Ventures - Evolve: The Power of Reinvent
	ion
DTSTAMP:20260915T174748Z
DTSTART:20260213T173100Z
DTEND:20260213T193100Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>A celebration of women entrepreneurs embracing change\, new 
	ideas\, and sustainable growth.</p><p></p><p>In today’s rapidly shifting b
	usiness landscape\, reinvention isn’t optional\, it’s essential. </p><p></
	p><p>Evolve: The Power of Reinvention brings together women entrepreneurs 
	who are navigating change with courage\, creativity\, and clarity. Whether
	 you’re pivoting your business model\, embracing new technology\, scaling 
	sustainably\, or redefining your own role as a founder\, this session is d
	esigned to support and inspire your next evolution.</p><p>With an empoweri
	ng\, forward-looking\, and resilient vibe\, this event highlights the trut
	h that reinvention can be energizing\, without leading to burnout. Discove
	r practical strategies and inspiring stories that help you move through ch
	ange with intention\, alignment\, and well-being.</p><p></p><p>Join us for
	 an uplifting conversation on what it really takes to evolve as a woman en
	trepreneur in an ever-changing economy.</p><p>Keynote speaker:</p><ul><li>
	<p>Sally Ng\, ICD.D: Client Partner at the Business Development Bank of Ca
	nada\, Founder of The Triple Effect\, and Owner of the Unity Community Cen
	tre</p></li></ul><p>Panel discussion:</p><ul><li><p>Anu Gupta\, Founder an
	d CEO of <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" href="https
	://www.bluenoseprobiotics.com/"><u>BLUENOSE Probiotics</u></a></p></li><li
	><p>Ghazaleh Afrahi\, Founder of <a target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener
	 noreferrer" href="https://shiftingshap3s.com/"><u>Shifting Shap3s</u></a>
	</p></li><li><p>Nadia Ivanova\, Co-Founder &amp\; Chief Product Officer at
