BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:vGxndl6ucvnrtukXVCsU0
SUMMARY:Give to Gain: How Women in Tech Are Building Each Other Up
DTSTAMP:20260915T174748Z
DTSTART:20260324T130000Z
DTEND:20260324T140000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>In celebration of Women’s Month and aligned with the Interna
	tional Women’s Day 2026 Give to Gain theme\, this panel brings together wo
	men working across tech and tech-adjacent roles to explore how generosity\
	, collaboration\, and reciprocity can drive meaningful change.</p><p>Give 
	to Gain challenges us to rethink success\, not as a zero-sum game\, but as
	 intentional multiplication. When women are supported through shared knowl
	edge\, mentorship\, advocacy\, resources\, and opportunity\, entire indust
	ries and communities benefit.</p><p></p><p>Through honest conversation and
	 lived experience\, our panelists will discuss how giving\, whether time\,
	 visibility\, sponsorship\, education\, or access—has shaped their careers
	\, strengthened their communities\, and helped create pathways for others.
	 The discussion will also explore what organizations and individuals can p
	ractically give to help close gender gaps in tech and build a more inclusi
	ve\, connected ecosystem.</p>
URL:https://members-digitalnovascotia.wildapricot.org/event-6554559
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:community
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
