SUMMARY:The AI Advantage - How Small Teams Are Outpacing Entire Industries
DTSTAMP:20260915T174748Z
DTSTART:20260325T210000Z
DTEND:20260325T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Speaker: Herman Liang<br>Join us for a groundbreaking talk t
	hat reveals how a <em>small tech team with AI‑native workflows outpaced tr
	aditional competitors and scaled to $1M+ in revenue</em>—all by rethinking
	 what developers are truly capable of in the age of AI.</p><p></p><p>​In t
