DTEND:20260601T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>It's official Claude's coming to Halifax (again) on Monday (
	Jun 1)<br><br>And this time to help you go from beginner to agent-curious\
	, here's why:<br><br>I'm seeing three camps right now:<br>→ the agent-pill
	ed\, who can't stop building and running their agents<br>→ the skeptics\, 
	who believe it's all hype<br>→ the curious\, who are exploring and tinkeri
	ng their way towards building real things<br><br>The curiosity starts the 
	conversation\, the hands-on building makes us learn.<br><br>So we're doing
	 a night for it.<br><br> Monday\, June 1<br> 6pm – 8pm<br> Volta\, 1800 Ar
	gyle St\, Halifax<br><br>In addition to meeting other Claude-curious/pille
	d people\, what you'll get:<br><br>→ Live demos of AI agents doing real bu
	siness work. The stuff that helps you picture what your agents could do.<b
	r>→ Understand the basics of building agents/workflows in simple words<br>
	→ A simple way to think about adding AI to your team<br>→ Honest answers a
	bout what AI can and can't do for your business yet<br>→ Q&amp\;A<br>→ Off
	icial Anthropic &amp\; Claude merch<br><br>If you're ready to map your age
	nts/workflows\, another limited-spot Claude workshop/event will be announc
	ed soon. Flag it in your RSVP\, if interested.</p>
