	\;reserved=0"><u>Competition Bureau</u></a> to learn about:</p><p></p><ul>
	<li><p>Why competition law matters to small businesses and entrepreneurs</
	p></li><li><p>How the Competition Bureau helps protect and promote competi
	tion</p></li><li><p>What you need to know about competition law and Made i
	n Canada claims🍁</p></li><li><p>How to protect your business with complian
	ce measures</p></li><li><p></p></li></ul><p><strong>About the Competition 
