	d we'll also touch on agent view\, Claude Code's local counterpart for man
	aging parallel sessions.</p><p>​Aimed at engineers\, tech leads\, and foun
	ders who've used Claude Code or the API\, but also open to designers\, PMs
	\, and anyone curious about where AI agents are heading. You don't need to
	 write code to follow along.</p><p></p><p>​Agenda</p><p>​6:00 PM — Doors o
	pen</p><p>​6:30 PM — Talk + live demo (1 hr)</p><p>​7:30 PM — Q&amp\;A (30
	 min)</p><p>​8:00 PM — Networking</p><p>​Refreshments provided.</p><p></p>
