	p>​An Inspiring Evening of Career Discovery\, Business Insight &amp\; Real
	-Life Experience</p><p>​Have you ever wondered what it takes to leave the 
	security of a paycheck and build something of your own? Or perhaps you're 
	considering whether entrepreneurship is the right path for your future?</p
	><p></p><p>​Join us for an engaging and thought-provoking event that explo
	res the key differences between being an employee and becoming an entrepre
	neur. Discover the opportunities\, challenges\, rewards\, and realities of
	 both career paths through open discussion\, practical insights\, and real
	-world experiences.</p><p></p><p>​Featured Presentation: A Serial Entrepre
	neur's Journey</p><p>​The highlight of the evening will be a captivating p
	resentation from a serial entrepreneur who has built multiple businesses f
	rom the ground up. Hear firsthand stories of:</p><ul><li><p>​-Taking the l
	eap from employee to entrepreneur</p></li><li><p>​-Overcoming setbacks and
	 failures</p></li><li><p>​-Finding opportunities where others see obstacle
	s</p></li><li><p>​-Building successful businesses and strong teams</p></li
	><li><p>​-Lessons learned from years of entrepreneurship</p></li><li><p>​-
	The mindset required to create lasting success</p></li><li><p></p></li></u
	l><p>​This authentic and inspiring journey will provide valuable insights 
	for aspiring entrepreneurs\, business owners\, students\, professionals\, 
	and anyone curious about creating their own path.</p><p></p><p>​<a target=
	"_blank" rel="nofollow noopener" href="https://docs.google.com/document/d/
	1Dexl5Iv7x89VVqqOfUNUxlfyVlfeI6CtFwDvrn_4_og/pub?utm_source=luma">CODE OF 
