DTSTART:20260728T210000Z
DTEND:20260728T230000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>Join us for an interactive meetup where we will explore vari
	ous topics in AI and machine learning. This event is open to all skill lev
	els\, from beginners to experienced data scientists\, interested in expand
	ing their knowledge and practical skills and meet new people.</p><p>WHEN: 
	Tuesday\, July 28th\, 6-8pm<br>LOCATION: VOLTA.</p><p>Speaker Lineup:</p><
	p>Leslie Canavera is the CEO and Co-Founder of PolArctic\, a pioneering co
	mpany using AI and data science to model the rapidly changing Arctic ecosy
	stem.<br>As a Yup’ik (Alaskan Native) tech leader\, she breaks traditional
	 boundaries by building advanced AI models that elevate Indigenous Knowled
	ge to equal footing with Western science.<br>Her work provides a mastercla
	ss in ethical AI development\, demonstrating how diverse perspectives can 
	directly solve real-world climate and maritime safety crises.<br>A former 
	Air Force officer and Forbes Next 1000 entrepreneur\, Leslie embodies the 
	powerful impact of women leading high-stakes\, cutting-edge technology ven
	tures.<br>Attendees will gain rare insight into how inclusive leadership a
	nd technical innovation can collide to drive global environmental and soci
	al change.</p>
