BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1bJjUWMnkaUzelyQXYl1o
SUMMARY:DEFCON Halifax August Meet-Up
DTSTAMP:20260915T174749Z
DTSTART:20260806T213000Z
DTEND:20260806T233000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>This month\, Anton Kats\, Founder of InstantHero\, will give
	 a talk titled "Distributed AI: Can we live up to the original promise of 
	Bitcoin?"</p><p><strong>DEFCON Halifax – August Meet-Up</strong></p><p>📅 𝗗
	𝗮𝘁𝗲: Thursday\, August 6th\, 2026</p><p>🕡 𝗧𝗶𝗺𝗲: 6:30 PM – 8:30 PM</p><p>📍 
	𝗟𝗼𝗰𝗮𝘁𝗶𝗼𝗻: Volta\, Halifax</p><p><br><strong>Please note:</strong> The Armo
	yan Centre's main entrance is currently closed due to construction. <a tar
	get="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" href="https://drive.google
	.com/file/d/1HaQDEMlyDSpYttrarfJePVOlx38Kqzer/view"><u>Please review the a
	ccess guide</u></a> for alternate routes to Volta. For the easiest access\
	, we recommend using <strong>Entrance 2 (2nd Floor Arch Entrance)</strong>
	 or <strong>Entrance 3 (Argyle Street Link Entrance)</strong>.<br><br><br>
	<strong>🎤 𝗙𝗲𝗮𝘁𝘂𝗿𝗲𝗱 𝗧𝗮𝗹𝗸:</strong></p><p><strong>Anton Kats</strong> is the
	 founder of InstantHero\, who has spent 20 years building production softw
	are across nearly every stack. AI pipelines. Real-time trading systems. Mo
	bile apps. He built InstantHero with a belief that technology should serve
	 people\, not extract from them.</p><p>Anton's talk\, titled <em>Distribut
	ed AI: Can we live up to the original promise of Bitcoin?</em><br><br>Proj
	ects like Akash Network are actively providing a marketplace for high-end 
	GPU rentals\, proving that AI infrastructure can be distributed. But that 
	is expected. What would seem impossible: distributed AI over consumer-grad
	e hardware is being proven possible by projects like Exo and prima.cpp. Th
	e question: can we all be part of the club\, or will it be Bitcoin 2.0 whe
	re only the few willing to invest in specialized hardware can join?</p><p>
	<br><strong>🔍 What's</strong> <strong>This All About?</strong></p><p><a ta
	rget="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.dc902.c
	a/"><u>DEFCON Halifax</u></a> is your local hub for hackers\, tinkerers\, 
	and cybersecurity pros. Whether you're just curious or deep in the field\,
	 you're welcome here. Come to learn\, connect\, and be part of Halifax's g
	rowing infosec community.</p><p></p><p><strong>💡 Why You Should Come:</str
	ong></p><ul><li><p>Meet fellow hackers\, makers\, and defenders</p></li><l
	i><p>Learn about the latest security trends and best practices</p></li><li
	><p>Share knowledge in a laid-back\, pressure-free environment</p></li><li
	><p>No sponsors. No sales. Just real people and real conversations</p></li
	></ul><p></p><p>🤝 <strong>Community-Powered and Proudly Sponsor-Free</stro
	ng></p><p><strong>DEFCON Halifax</strong> aims to create an environment fr
	ee from sales pitches. We depend on our community's generosity to cover sm
	all expenses. When you register for your free ticket\, you'll see an optio
	nal donation field. Please donate a few dollars.</p><p>All donations go di
	rectly to enhancing DC902 events.</p><p>Thank you for helping us grow this
	 community!</p><p></p><p><strong>📅 𝗦𝗰𝗵𝗲𝗱𝘂𝗹𝗲:</strong></p><ul><li><p>6:30 P
	M – Doors Open + Networking</p></li><li><p>6:50 PM – Community News &amp\;
	 Update</p></li><li><p>6:55 PM - Welcome</p></li><li><p>7:00 PM – Anton's 
	Talk / Live Stream Starts</p></li><li><p>7:40 PM – Q&amp\;A</p></li><li><p
	>8:00 PM – More Networking</p></li><li><p>8:30 PM – Wrap-Up</p></li></ul><
	p></p>
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/defcon-halifax-august-meet-up-tickets-19946
	87484963?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:community
END:VEVENT
