DESCRIPTION:<p>Most AI events are built for developers. This one is built f
	or business owners — practical\, plain-language\, and focused on what actu
	ally moves your business.</p><p></p><p>​AI for Business is a free monthly 
	lunch meetup at Volta where non-technical business owners meet to learn pr
	actical AI — specific tactics you can use to save time\, make more money\,
	 or improve the quality of your product or service.</p><p></p><p>​<strong>
	This month: proposals</strong>. Watch a live demo of turning rough discove
	ry notes into a scoped\, priced\, client-ready proposal in about 20 minute
	s. This workflow helped one professional services firm recover 100+ billab
	le hours annually and increased the consistency and quality of their propo
	sals.</p><p></p><p>​Everyone who attends leaves with the exact workflow fr
	om the demo\, ready to use on your next proposal.</p><p></p><p>​Who this i
	s for: if you're a business owner who sends proposals\, this is for you. A
	lso great for business owners and professional service firms interested in
	 using AI in their business. Zero technical background needed.</p><p></p><
	p>​<strong>Agenda</strong><br>12:00 — Doors\, lunch\, networking<br>12:15 
	— Live demo: AI-powered proposal building<br>12:35 — Q&amp\;A<br>12:50 — T
	rade your #1 AI problem with another owner<br>1:00 — Wrap · stick around u
	ntil 1:30 if you want to keep talking</p><p>​Free to attend. Space is limi
	ted\, register in advance.<br><br><strong>Location:</strong> Volta\, Armoy
	an Boardroom · <strong>Sept 9\, 12:00–1:30 PM</strong></p>
URL:https://luma.com/61x27wg7
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:community
