SUMMARY:Behind the Business: Subswap
DTSTAMP:20260915T174749Z
DTSTART:20260909T210000Z
DTEND:20260909T220000Z
DESCRIPTION:<p>The first of a event of a live interview series for Nova Sco
	tia entrepreneurs. Real stories\, open floor\, real networking.</p><p></p>
	<p><strong>One local business. The real story. A room that talks back.</st
	rong></p><p><em>Every founder has a version of the story they tell at part
	ies\, and a version that's actually true. We're after the second one.</em>
	</p><p></p><p>Whether you're a seasoned business owner or have no entrepre
	neurial experience at all\, we believe every person has the insight to imp
	rove a business. So we built this platform to spotlight local businesses\,
	 connect entrepreneurs and like minded people\, and help a business throug
	h its struggles with direct support from the room.</p><p></p><p>Behind the
	 Business is a live interview series for Nova Scotia entrepreneurs. You'll
	 hear the real story straight from the founders\, an intimate behind the s
	cenes look at how they're navigating the business and getting it on its fe
	et. Then the floor opens. You can ask them anything\, and they get to ask 
	YOU for advice.</p><p></p><p><strong>GUEST BUSINESS: SUBSWAP</strong></p><
	p>Everyone in Halifax has a bad subletting story. SubSwap is the Halifax s
	tartup fixing it. Swipe on potential roommates\, match on real compatibili
	ty\, go find a place together. Swipe. Match. Move in.</p><p>Two sided mark
	etplace\, early stage\, in the middle of the hard part. Good conversation.
	</p><p></p><p><strong>WHAT TO EXPECT</strong></p><p>About 90 mins. Doors o
	pen\, then the story\, then the interview\, then the floor\, then open net
	working. Free. Bring nothing but good energy.</p><p>Any stage\, any indust
	ry. Thirty years in or three months in. You don't need a business to come\
	, you just need to like the people who start them.</p><p></p><p>Register s
	o we know how many chairs to put out. <strong>FREE FOR ALL.</strong></p><p
	></p>
URL:https://www.eventbrite.ca/e/behind-the-business-subswap-tickets-1998017
	569335
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CATEGORIES:community
END:VEVENT
