	\, People's Choice\, and a few surprises<br>🤝 A room full of builders\, fo
	unders\, and people who make things happen here<br>🍕 Coffee\, lunch\, snac
	ks\, all covered</p><p></p><p>​Bring a laptop - come with a team (2-4 peop
	le) or roll in solo\, and we'll help you find your people.</p><p></p><p>​N
