	b1f64c4cc4da0fd" alt="" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto" /></div><div
	 style="margin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 4
	00;text-align: left;"><p>Blyyss is a Halifax platform for local and indepe
	ndent grocers, the stores no major delivery platform serves. We started by
	 running weekly deliveries from these stores ourselves, which is how we le
	arned their real problem: most have never had a weekly flyer or any online
	 presence, because producing one requires a design team and structured pro
	duct data they don't have.</p><p><strong><strong>Presenters: </strong></st
	rong><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/conrad-scotchburn/" title="https
	://www.linkedin.com/in/conrad-scotchburn/" target="_blank" data-msys-click
	track="0" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Conrad Scotchburn</a>, Founde
	r &amp; CEO. <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/smit-kanpariya/" title="
	https://www.linkedin.com/in/smit-kanpariya/" target="_blank" data-msys-cli
	cktrack="0" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer">Smit Kanpariya</a>, Co-Foun
	der &amp; CTO.</p></div><div style="margin: 20px 0;line-height: 22px;"><im
	g src="https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2F119197
	2566%2F57002081887%2F1%2Foriginal.20260826-190253?h=740&w=1200&auto=format
	%2Ccompress&q=75&sharp=10&s=19df6df44356ced231f7b3b5f5918f12" alt="" style
	="max-width: 100%; height: auto" /></div><div style="margin: 20px 10px;fon
	t-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left;"><p>Myle
	s is an AI companion that lives on your computer, designed to be yours by 
	default. It works with your real files and tasks while remembering what ma
	tters between conversations. By staying local, it ensures your data never 
	leaves your machine unless you explicitly allow it to reach out. Think of 
	it as a single agent with many skills that reasons on your own hardware, g
	iving you full control over privacy and capability.</p><p><strong><strong>
	Presenter: </strong></strong>Michael Page, Founder </p></div><div style="m
	argin: 20px 0;line-height: 22px;"><img src="https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A
	%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2F1193182382%2F57002081887%2F1%2Foriginal.202
	60910-170730?h=740&w=1200&auto=format%2Ccompress&q=75&sharp=10&s=e10dda652
	aa1036bc96d437ce22d1a9a" alt="" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto" /></
	div><div style="margin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-w
	eight: 400;text-align: left;"><p>Beyond the Chatbot: Putting AI to Work<br
	>Geodesa AI demonstrates a voice agent tackling a realistic business task,
	 then puts the AI behind it to the test. See how different models handle c
	hanging requests and company rules—and compare their reliability, speed, a
	nd cost. A practical look at what it takes to move from an impressive AI d
	emo to something useful in your own business or product.</p><p><strong><st
	rong>Presenter: </strong></strong>Cadence Agyirey</p></div><div style="mar
	gin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-ali
	gn: left;"><p>NOTE: If you are unable to attend any of our events please t
	ake a minute and cancel your ticket. This allows our team to better prepar
	e for every event.</p><p>By attending this event, you agree to be photogra
	phed and/or filmed and give permission to Volta to use your image in promo
	tional and/or marketing materials.</p></div></div>
END:VEVENT
