	><strong>When:</strong></strong> Monday, September 21 , 2026 from 6:00pm -
	 8:00pm</p><p><strong><strong>Where: </strong></strong>Volta, 1800 Argyle 
	St., Unit 801, Halifax, NS, B3J 3N8</p><p><strong><strong>Please note:</st
	rong></strong> The Armoyan Centre's main entrance is currently closed due 
