	; height: auto" /></div><div style="margin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line
	-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left;"><p>Darryl Wright is the 
	founder of Halifax's own <a href="https://punkscience.ca/" title="https://
	punkscience.ca/" target="_blank" data-msys-clicktrack="0" rel="nofollow no
	opener noreferrer"><strong><strong>Punk Science Studios Inc.</strong></str
	ong></a>, and the current CTO of London England's <a href="https://www.bos
	sagames.com/" title="https://www.bossagames.com/" target="_blank" data-msy
	s-clicktrack="0" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"><strong><strong>Bossa 
	Games</strong></strong></a>. Punk Science is a video game and technology d
	evelopment company formed in 2015 and made dormant for a time in 2017 when
	 Darryl joined Ubisoft Halifax as Technical Director. Darryl has worked in
	 industries as diverse as telecom, med-tech and IT but spent the last 20+ 
	years in video games where he has worked for both small indie studios and 
	large AAA studios like EA Canada and Ubisoft on projects raging from FIFA 
	and NHL to Assassin's Creed: Rebellion. Darryl is bullish on the future th
	at AI-assisted development can deliver in games and technology in general 
	and excited to share the possibilities with a wider audience.</p></div><di
	v style="margin: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 
	400;text-align: left;"><p><strong><strong>Facilitator: </strong></strong><
	a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sam-eugene-silver/" title="https://www
	.linkedin.com/in/sam-eugene-silver/" target="_blank" data-msys-clicktrack=
	"0" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"><strong><strong>Sam Silver</strong>
	</strong></a></p></div><div style="margin: 20px 0;line-height: 22px;"><img
	 src="https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2F1175875
