	2Ccompress&q=75&sharp=10&s=86b2413c3f8dadb98e7d7fd75e13236b" alt="" style=
	"max-width: 100%; height: auto" /></div><div style="margin: 20px 10px;font
	-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left;"><p>Sam S
	ilver is a Vibe Coding Coach and founder of <a href="https://www.bayloch.t
	ech/" title="https://www.bayloch.tech/" target="_blank" data-msys-clicktra
	ck="0" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"><strong><strong>Bayloch Technolo
	gies</strong></strong></a> who helps businesses build applications in hour
	s instead of weeks using AI-assisted coding. Having spent years honing AI-
	assisted development, he now empowers others to embrace AI as an augmentat
	ion to their capabilities.</p></div><div style="margin: 20px 10px;font-siz
	e: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left;"><p><strong><
