X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<div>Join us for a CEO only breakfast with hos
	t Bethany Deshpande!</div><div style="margin-top: 20px"><div style="margin
	: 20px 10px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align:
	 left;"><p><strong><strong>When: </strong></strong>Wednesday, September 23
	, 2026 from 10:00am - 11:00am</p><p><strong><strong>Where: </strong></stro
	ng>Birds Nest Cafe, 1547 Barrington St, Halifax, NS B3J 1Z4</p><p><strong>
	<strong>Description:</strong></strong></p><p>Join us for an intimate break
	fast at Bird’s Nest Café <strong><strong>for CEOs of Volta Resident compan
	ies</strong></strong> on Wednesday, September 23 from 10:00 AM to 11:00 AM
	.</p><p>Hosted by <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bethanydeshpande/" 
	title="https://www.linkedin.com/in/bethanydeshpande/" target="_blank" data
	-msys-clicktrack="0" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer"><strong><strong>Be
	thany Deshpande</strong></strong></a>, entrepreneur, facilitator, and inno
	vation leader, this gathering brings together CEOs from across Volta’s Res
	ident community for candid conversation, shared insights, and meaningful p
	eer connection in a relaxed setting.</p><p>Whether you’re navigating early
	-stage challenges, growing your team, or scaling your company, this is an 
	opportunity to connect with fellow Resident CEOs who understand the realit
	ies of building and leading a startup.</p><p><strong><strong>Please note: 
	This breakfast is reserved specifically for CEOs of current Volta Resident
	 companies.</strong></strong></p><p><br></p><p><strong><strong>About Betha
	ny:</strong></strong></p></div><div style="margin: 20px 0;line-height: 22p
	x;"><img src="https://img.evbuc.com/https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.evbuc.com%2Fimages%2
	F1170407893%2F57002081887%2F1%2Foriginal.20251107-143206?h=740&w=1200&auto
	=format%2Ccompress&q=75&sharp=10&s=ab0b707b21723ff423dd59e05f75eb4e" alt="
	" style="max-width: 100%; height: auto" /></div><div style="margin: 20px 1
	0px;font-size: 15px;line-height: 22px;font-weight: 400;text-align: left;">
	<p>Bethany Deshpande is an entrepreneur, facilitator, and innovation leade
	r who helps people and organizations turn bold ideas into meaningful impac
	t. As the Founder and former CEO of SomaDetect, she grew a deep-tech start
	up from lab prototype to global scale, working at the intersection of scie
	nce, technology, and agriculture. Today, through her consulting and facili
	tation work, Bethany supports founders, innovators, and changemakers acros
	s Canada in navigating growth, leadership, and purpose-driven entrepreneur
	ship. She brings heart, honesty, and deep experience to every conversation
	, and is passionate about helping founders connect, reflect, and grow toge
	ther.</p></div></div>
END:VEVENT
